1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,945
Meet Ramesh. An ordinary man with an exhausting life.

2
00:00:03,995 --> 00:00:09,413
All he wants, after a long day… is to come home, and sleep.

3
00:00:10,637 --> 00:00:15,695
But next door, the drilling never stops. His bed shakes. His walls tremble.

4
00:00:15,745 --> 00:00:18,600
His nights turn sleepless.

5
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:22,315
So he records it. Every tremor. Every night.

6
00:00:22,633 --> 00:00:26,751
He takes the government to court. But his evidence is tampered.

7
00:00:26,801 --> 00:00:29,108
The records are rewritten. And officially…

8
00:00:29,158 --> 00:00:31,732
there was never any construction.

9
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:37,400
Instead of justice, Ramesh is handed a defamation case.

10
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:41,522
That very night, he lies awake again. The bed shakes. But this time…

11
00:00:41,572 --> 00:00:43,994
it isn't the construction.

12
00:00:45,783 --> 00:00:51,422
By morning, rescuers pull survivors from the rubble, one by one. But Ramesh…

13
00:00:51,472 --> 00:00:56,368
is still trapped. No one knows where he is.

14
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:02,392
What if the vibrations we ignore today…

15
00:01:02,488 --> 00:01:04,830
could save lives tomorrow?

16
00:01:05,233 --> 00:01:09,966
Introducing TremorMesh. Sense, map, and prove every tremor.

17
00:01:10,016 --> 00:01:15,307
Because every tremor tells a story. TremorMesh — Every Tremor Matters.

